            "description": "Genome-wide genotyping (Illumina OmniExpress 700k, exome chip 250k) carried out in 2015 on DNA extracted from blood/saliva samples collected during the main Generation Scotland recruitment (2006-2011). QC included population stratification analysis and imputation to the 1000 Genomes dataset.",
